Wands are generally only dangerous to fighter-types if the person using
them on you is fast or you're moving down a corridor (or they're
sufficiently sturdy that you can't kill them quickly).  If you don't
stand on a movement direction relative to the user, you can't be
targetted.

Mundane missiles are more worrisome, because some quite common ranged-
attack monsters (Uruk-Hai) sometimes have poisoned arrows... and
Uruk-Hai come in packs. (A little caution goes a long way, though.)

